<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia SP Setia year net up 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia SP Setia year net up 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     34.36    vs	30.78</p>
<p>    Net profit		 43.74    vs	30.18</p>
<p>    Turnover		  355.21    vs     413.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   59.77    vs	45.44</p>
<p>    Minorities	  add   8.70    vs less  1.20</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries   loss  5.33    vs loss  0.07</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is SP Setia Bhd. It is involved in civil engineering and infrastructure construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-23 8911)</p>
</text>
